# InkTime temporary unfixed-CVE allowlist for the pinned Python slim base.
# Owner: inktime-security
# Expiry: 2026-09-30
# Reason: Trivy 0.60 reports these Debian base-image CVEs without a FixedVersion;
#         re-evaluate the pinned base image before expiry. Unlisted findings fail CI.
CVE-2025-69720
CVE-2026-13221
# Debian forky's libsqlite3-0 3.53.4-2 contains the upstream 3.53.2 FTS5 fix,
# but Trivy still evaluates the installed package against Debian trixie's
# no-DSA entry. Dockerfile build-time version verification remains required;
# remove these entries when trixie publishes a fixed package/metadata.
CVE-2026-11822
CVE-2026-11824
# CVE-2026-14456 is limited to OpenSSL QUIC server pending connections. InkTime
# serves HTTP with Gunicorn and creates no QUIC listener; Debian 13 currently
# reports fix_deferred with no FixedVersion. Remove after the pinned base is fixed.
